  {
   "id": 11342,
   "type": "1",
   "stem": "<p><p>世の中にはさまざまな資格があふれているが、資格を取った<u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;<u style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</u><span style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</u><span style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">　★　</u><span style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">世間は甘くないらしい。</span></p></p><p><br></p>",
